fact WorkItem(id: "WI-045", description: some(value: "026.1 Q1: Substitution carries Value. Rewrite kb/subst.rs to HashMap<VarId, Value> with bind_term(v, TermId) fast path and bind_value(v, Value) for external sources. Migrate all callers (resolve.rs, discrim.rs, mod.rs::{match_term, reify, walk, apply_subst}, persist_subst.rs, typing.rs unifier) via mechanical bind(v, tid) → bind_term(v, tid). Pure refactor, semantics-preserving. Acceptance: cargo test -p anthill-core green with no other behavior change. Proposal 026.1 Q1 + §Substitution: VarId → Value."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-042"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Verified(at: "2026-04-21T13:04:38Z"))
